│ intended behavior of resetting the primary   │
│ key. The AutoField is designed to manage     │
│ primary keys, and setting it to None doesn't │
│ provide a mechanism for it to handle the     │
│ primary key generation as expected. The      │
│ simplest solution is to prevent the          │
